PRINT """Welcome to Inux!

Setup runs one step at a time:
1. GitHub CLI (gh): download the pinned version, sign in through your browser, and verify access.
2. Markdown converter (adf): install the manually built binary from the repository and verify conversion.
3. Atlassian CLI (acli): download the pinned version, sign in to Jira through your browser, and verify access.

Tools are installed in your private Inux tools directory. Matching installations and logins are reused.
After each verified step, type done to continue. Any other reply stops setup.
If a step fails, setup stops there and reports the error with its source line.
"""

CONTEXT
    Install only at the specified private path, using a unique private temporary
    directory. Create missing parents only as needed. Verify the requested checks
    and executable permissions before replacing a working tool. Remove only that
    temporary directory on success or failure, plus newly created parents that
    remain empty on failure.
AS install_rules

DO Resolve setup inputs. Return an object with windows TRUE only on Windows;
    storage from its explicit override or NULL; and repository, adf_ref,
    gh_version, and acli_version from explicit overrides or NULL. Normalize
    non-NULL gh/acli version overrides without a leading v. AS options

IF @options.windows is TRUE
    RUN powershell.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command "[Environment]::GetFolderPath('UserProfile'); Write-Output 'windows'; [Runtime.InteropServices.RuntimeInformation]::OSArchitecture"
    AS host_result

    DO Parse @host_result.stdout into an object with home, os, and arch. Normalize
        AMD64/X64 to amd64 and ARM64 to arm64. Require windows on amd64. AS platform
ELSE
    RUN sh
        printf '%s\n' "$HOME"
        uname -s
        uname -m
    AS host_result

    DO Parse @host_result.stdout into an object with home, os, and arch. Normalize
        Darwin to darwin, Linux to linux, x86_64 to amd64, and aarch64 to arm64.
        Require darwin or linux on amd64 or arm64. AS platform

DO Resolve absolute bin as <storage>/tools/bin, with private gh, adf, and acli
    paths under bin (.exe on Windows). Use @options.storage when non-NULL,
    otherwise <home>/.inux with home from @platform.home. Return an object
    with bin, gh, adf, and acli. AS host

USE setup-gh.flow
ASK "GitHub CLI is ready and authenticated. Type done to continue to adf, or anything else to stop." AS github_confirmation

IF @github_confirmation is not exactly "done"
    RETURN "Setup stopped after GitHub CLI."

USE setup-adf.flow
ASK "ADF converter is ready. Type done to continue to Atlassian CLI, or anything else to stop." AS adf_confirmation

IF @adf_confirmation is not exactly "done"
    RETURN "Setup stopped after ADF converter."

USE setup-acli.flow
ASK "Atlassian CLI is ready and authenticated. Type done to finish setup, or anything else to stop." AS atlassian_confirmation

IF @atlassian_confirmation is not exactly "done"
    RETURN "Setup stopped after Atlassian CLI."

PRINT Report the GitHub and Atlassian versions and authentication states from @github and @atlassian, the verified converter at @converter.path, and @host.bin in a compact table.
RETURN "Inux setup is complete."
